<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Ipunu Kiwoyeti (puu) NT Portions</book>
  <para style="h">Sake</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mughande wu Sake</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sake</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mughande wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAKE</para>
  <para style="imt">Dikotulu di mughande</para>
  <para style="im">Mughande wu Sake wilongi na uwarise mukute Nzambi awuvu wusunzu mbure tsyotsu mu bulongu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Sake amabe mwane ngudji Djesu, amabe yivunde va ghari barumitsi mu dibundu diteghe o Serusaleme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12:17">Bis 12.17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:13-21">15.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:18">21.18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:19">Bag 1.19</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:9">2.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="im">Mughande Sake wiveyi dyele ombu bakereti. Dyele dyeni munongu mbé wusulu monyu nane yitu mu Djesu yirondili. Bango yitu borungule uvonde dyele dyeni ombu Nzambi, na Nzambi obaveghe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1.2-8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:13-18">3.13-18</ref></char>). Pa bane dyele dyeni, borungule uwarile mu motsu amebungi mutu: purulu tsi monyu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-4">1.2-4</ref></char>), nzale ube yisine (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5.1-6</ref></char>), nzale uvaghe dibi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-18">1.2-18</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:1-9">4.1-9</ref></char>) na dunangu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:13-16">4.13-16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="im">Mughande wivosi rye uvayile yitu mu Nzambi ebeyisi o usale. Tughorungule utsane mu dinonge na Nzambi mbana tughédilasi mu motwivayi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2.14-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="im">Usale, diwendili uwarile dibi. Usale uwamuse abavu na nzale wandi. Usale tsi utabulile bambatsi bunzonzi tsi ube va djulu owu. Usale ukebene mu posulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3.1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="im">Murenditsi esoniyili dibundu mu dyambu di bidjaghe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:6">2.6</ref></char>). Batu aberendisili bane nzale ube bisine. Mughande wibaghandisi ulenze bidjaghe dibandu budjaghe bwowu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>). Woni wimwélubuse bisine mu bidungu abi busine ebeyi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5.1-6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="im">Va disukusulu di mughande, Sake elongi bakereti ughabuse abetsyémuyi vale na ngenze. Ebalongi uwamusene wandi na usambile mu basusu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mughande awu Sake amarende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Awu menu Sake nyirendi mughande éwuwu. Nyidji musatsi Nzambi na Fumu Djesu Kirisete. Nyisimbi mukute wotsu wu Nzambi awuvu wupanzighe mu bulongu bwotsu.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi eveyi dyele ombu djowu abekewakise ombu wandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Baane ba tadji bami! Pa maghughe maminongu mipwele meduruyili, banu mu nzangu dji neni. <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>Djabanu yiri, pa yitu yenu yitsiware mu maghughe, duware tinde uware. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Vengu duware teno disukusulu, na dube duwelimine, djowu abamaneghe na bamaware mu yinyuni, mba dughoghambu na yime.<verse eid="JAS 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Pa wumosi va ghari enu eghambu na dyele, avondi Nzambi, na djandi omuveghe dyele dyeni. Mumbari djandi, eveyi pwele na murime mosi. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Tumbe ayivondi na yitu, ayabe na bakemi. Odjivu na bakemi, adji nane mibidji ami mupunge etinde yari na yari. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Mutu ewune, ayatase yi Fumu omuveghe ne yime. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Murime andi wughabunu, agha asigheme mu mutsanu andi.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yidjaghe na yisine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Mwane tadji odjivu yidjaghe, abi mu nzangu mumba Nzambi amamunangule<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:20">Luk 6.20</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>Yisine, abi djawandi mu nzangu, mumba Nzambi omudyamise. Mba ofu, nane biriri bi kembu bighumuyili. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Nyangu djibali, na yusile wandi yighumusi biriri. Bibonduyi notsyemuse kembu. Munongu mosi, olebe na busine vengu ofu.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dumangu na purulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Ubwedji ombu mutu oyiwarili mu dumangu. Mba ave dumangu dusukile, odile dughabe du monyu awu Nzambi amalonge bobemurondi.<verse eid="JAS 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Ave mutu ebili mu dumangu, ayavose yiri Nzambi embangi, mumbari Nzambi aghorungule umangu, na aghémangi mutu. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Nzale tsyandi tsibive mu murime, tsimubeyi mu uvaghe mabi. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Dunyungi pa dumavyoghulile dwiburi dibi, dibi pa dimawele dibeyi o dufu.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Baane ba tadji ba durondu, duyakedyonge. <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Nzambi oyiveyi peghulu tsyotsu atsiboti na bisaku abiwelemine. Djandi omasunde, nyangu, ngondi na bambwelili. Adji yidjalale aghékaluyi, aghéghéluyi nzime mu udusile o tsi piseme. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Amaronde djabeni utuveghe monyu mu mbembu andi adjivu ngenze, mumbari tukebe abateghe, va ghari bisundu byandi.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wulwanu na dedilanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Baane ba tadji ba durondu, rangeminanu didi: kale mutu abi na pughu djuwulu, tumbe ayabe na maswasu movose, ayasunga unyoghe. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Mutu na kabu aghorungule uvaghe mambu amasungeme va wusu Nzambi. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Kaboghu, bwaghanu mambu motsu manzoruru amavu mu mirime myenu, bukani abwidubeyi o dibi, duyamwévaghe mabi. Dilanu na mirime misunde mbembu adji Nzambi amavare mu djenu. Mbembu eni, djine mangolu modughobule o dufu.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Duyasingene bu mu uwulu mbembu Nzambi, tumbe djidughuswanu. Pa dwiwulu yike uwulu mba dughédughusu, dwikedyonge. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Pa yi mutu esingini bu nowulu mbembu eni na aghédjidughusu, abaghunu na mutu oyikeghengili mu dumwenu na elabi nane avu, <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>atsunina yinzi yandi, ewendi yari yisusu, na elibeni nane yinzi yandi yivu. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Tumbe oyikeluli mughaghe Nzambi, na ewusalisi, Nzambi omusake mu yisalu yeni. Ayawulu yike uwulu mughaghe nowulibene, awudedili na Nzambi omuveghe myule. Mumbari mughaghe eni wuboti, wune mangolu motughobule mu mabi.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Pa mutu etasi yi adji mudukitsi Nzambi, mba aghane yidamambe, kaboghu ekedyonge, bungange bwandi bughane tsongu. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Bungange abuboti va wusu Tate Nzambi, bwiwendili yi mutu akelisi burange bisyane na bakwili abetsoyi. Djabeni wandi akebini mumba mambu mabive ma bulongu makemukotise mu dibi.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Duyavaghaange duvyakusunu va ghari batu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Baane ba tadji, djenu bo dwivayili yitu mu Djesu Kirisete, Fumu etu bundumbe, duyabe na yimbambile. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Tangudji, batu babedji bekoti o yibengunu yenu. Wumosi adware bikutu bi dufunu duneni na moru wikadimi. Awune yidjaghe, adware bikutu bi mwinzi. <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Pa wighobisi odjivu na bikutu bilyome, wimutsinguli dibaale: «Yitsane va mbure adjiboti.» Ombu yidjaghe wimutsinguli: «Ba diteli vo tsane va tsi.» <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>Ave dwivayili nane, tsi dupasu dwivayi va ghari enu? Dughésosisi na mirime mibive?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Baane ba tadji ba durondu, wulwanu burange: Nzambi asamasole bidjaghe va misu ma bulongu mumbari bakevayile yitu ombu Djesu Kirisete na bakebe na busine bungenze, bakedile bufumu bu djulu abu amalonge ombu djowu abemurondi? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Tumbe djenu, dumalenze bidjaghe! Tsi bisine bedutsoyisi na bedubeyi va wusu banzonzi? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Djowu belenzi boti dine adi Nzambi amaduveghe.<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Pa dwidughusu mughaghe awurendu, awiruyili ombu Nzambi na wivosi rye: «Ronde mutu naghu nane wikerondili ndebeni», dwivayi burange<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Tumbe pa dwivayi yimbambile, dibi dwivayi, mughaghe Moyise widukilisi mumbari dwiwulenzi. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Ne yi mutu ededili mighaghe myotsu mi Nzambi, tumbe pa atsi lenze ne wumosi, kaboghu ane mbele va wusu mughaghe wotsu. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Dibile nane, mumba Nzambi omavose rye: «Wuyatube bukali», amamwévose rye: «Wuyaboke mutu.» Kaboghu, ne wughatube bukali tumbe wutsiboke mutu, wumabise mughaghe Nzambi. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Mu dyoni, vosanu na salisanu nane djowu abe Nzambi otabulile bunzonzi. Olabe yeri dutsidedile mughaghe awuvu na mangolu modudjeyise. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Pa mutu aghane yingebe ombu basusu, ave Nzambi omutabulile bunzonzi, aghomulabe ngebe wandi. Tumbe odjivu na yingebe ombu basusu, aghobe na ghome bunzonzi.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yitu mu Djesu na bisalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Baane ba tadji, pa mutu evosi yiri ane yitu, tumbe aghévayi ame Nzambi etsinguli, yitu yandi yighane tsongu. Yoni yighorungule umughobule. <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Tangudji mwane tadji, mughetu vo dibale, aghane bikutu vo bighudji bi kale yilumbu. <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>Pa mutu va ghari enu ebatsinguli: «Wendanu mu duvotsu, yotsi na nzale biyadughaange», tumbe aghébaveyi bime abibaghambu, banu na makure. Dyoni dighane tsongu. <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Munongu mosi na yitu ayighane bisalu, yifu.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Tangudji, mutu ovose yi: «Ndedju wune yitu, menu nine bisalu.» Ndasi tsyeni wubile na yitu ayighane bisalu, menu ngawulase yitu yami mu bisalu byami. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Widjabi yiri vadji bu Nzambi mosi? Wivayi diboti. Ne binyuni bibi bedidjabi wandi, na bereyimi na ghome. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Yiduke nane nde, balemwéwulase yiri yitu ayighane bisalu, yifu? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Tadji etu Aberaame amalabene asungeme va misu ma Nzambi ave amavaghulile mwane andi Yisaake<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:9">Dib 22.9</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Wilabi yi yitu yandi yimawendaange va mosi na bisalu byandi, na mu byoni yitu yandi yimadughusu. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Anane dyoni dimadughusu nane Bisonu bi Nzambi bivosili: «Aberaame amavayile Nzambi yitu, na mu yoni Nzambi amamusinge yiri asungeme<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41.8</ref></char></note>.» Na Nzambi amamunengile mbatsi andi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Dib 15.6</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Kaboghu, dwilabi yiri mutu amasungughu va wusu Nzambi, dibandu bisalu biboti byo evayi, tsike bu mu yitu yandi. <verse eid="JAS 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Rangeminanu wandi Rabe yimbembu. Nzambi amamulabe asungeme mu dyo amavaghe. Amadile bilumbi, akebasweghe na amabalonge nzile susu djurinine<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Sos 2.1-21</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="JAS 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Nane dunyuru adughane muvumu dufwile,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="JAS 2:26">anane yitu ayighane bisalu yifwile wandi.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kelisanu ndimi tsyenu burange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Baane ba tadji, bapwele va ghari enu bayarombe ube milonzi, mumbari dwidjabi yiri ave djetu milonzi tutabululu bunzonzi dyughale uvyoghulile adi basusu. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Djetu botsu tune mbé rughulu tsi minongu mipwele twivayi amagha maboti. Pa mutu aghavaghe dibi mu uvose, mutu ewune asungeme, edjabi ukelise dunyuru dwandi. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Bevakiyi budilu mu munu kabele, mumbari akebadedile, bakemubeyise djawotsu.<figure style="fig" alt="Le cheval et son mors" file="WA04016b.tif" size="col" loc="3.1-5" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="3.3">Budilu mu munu kabele</figure> <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Tasetyanu wandi bawatange, ne nane babile baneni mba mipunge amineni mibatsayisi, mudji yisalu yigheyi mune, na yoni mubeyitsi ebasungiyili mu uwende o yari ayi erondi. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Munongu mosi na dulimi du mutu. Dulimi olembu ugheyi enyemi bisalu bi neni. Dighaghele di mudji dinyenzi musiru wotsu.<verse eid="JAS 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Dulimi dudji nane mudji. Dibi di dineni divu mu manyuru metu. Ebivisi dunyuru dwotsu. Ebanzi mudji awibungi monyu wotsu wu mutu. Mudji eni wiruyili tindi wune bulungi bu mudji. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Mutu orungule udyamise minongu myotsu mi bibulu, batsoli, bilandile na banyame ba mambe wandi. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Tumbe djandi aghorungule udyamise dulimi. Dulimi yileme yibive yigha musighe. Dubase na ndombu adjiboki batu. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Twiyitsi Fumu odjivu Tadji etu na dulimi na twiloghi batu abe djandi amasunde mu yibaghunu yandi na dulimi dweni wandi. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Bighume bi duyitsu na bi miloghu bipali mu munu wune wumosi. Baane ba tadji, diyabe nane! <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Mambe maboti na mabive maghépali yileke yimosi. <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Baane ba tadji, mungengi orungule ubure minzunzebali? Munzunzibali aghobure mingengi wandi. Yileke yi mambe maboti yighopalise mambe makali.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyele adiruyili ombu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Vadji mutu va ghari enu etasi ube na dyele na dudjabu? Adilasi mu mutsanu wuboti, avayi bisalu na ukesunze na dyele. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Tumbe pa wune ngusu djineni mu murime aghu, na wirondi wuvyoghulile ba mbatsi wandi, kaboghu uyakedodise, na uyavinze ufure va mbure ngenze. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Dyele dyédine digheruyile ombu Nzambi, dyele di bulongu. Yinyuni yi Nzambi yigha mune, diruyili ombu Dyabu. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Pa batu bane ngusu na berondi wuvyoghulile bambatsi, mambu maghomwéwelemine mba mabi ma minongu mipwele mobe vane wandi. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Tumbe dyele adiruyili ombu Nzambi tetegha dilyome. Va djulu vane disigheme, divole, dine bilunzi, dibase na yingebe na bisalu biboti. Dighane yimbambile na pende. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Batu aberondi duvotsu beveyi basusu duvotsu nane tsangu, na kabusulu adji bedili monyu wusungeme.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Batu aberondi mambu ma bulongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Povini na mitsundu va ghari enu wuke biruyisini? Tsi nzale tsyenu tsibive tsivovini mu mirime myenu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Dwinyungili bime tumbe dughébidili. Ladibandu, dubile babokitsi. Dwinyungili bime, tumbe dughérunguli ubidile. Kaboghu dwitsundi na dwivovini. Dughédili ayi dwirombi, mumbari dughévondi Nzambi. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Ave dwisambili dughédili, mumbari dwisambili na matase mabive, mu udugusu nzale tsyenu tsikulini. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Djenu abe dugha dusigheme, dughédjabi yiri pa mutu erondi bulongu, adji mbeni Nzambi? Mutu oyirondi bime bi bulongu, ebi mbeni Nzambi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Dwitasi yiri Bisonu bi Nzambi bifuri ave bivosili yiri na diwavi Nzambi erondili pwele Yinyuni ayi amasunze mu djetu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bighume abibi bighabisonughu mu yivighu ayi kale na yighone: «Nzambi erondili pwele Yinyuni ayi amasunze mu djetu.» Bisonughu mu mabuku masusu maghulu.</char></note>? <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Tumbe etuveyi yese yivyoghulile, nane barendile mu dibuku di Nzambi yiri: «Nzambi ekambisi abavu na dunangu, tumbe eveyi yese ombu djowu abakesunze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ranganu: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Ban 3.34</ref></char>, dibongu mu dibuku adirendu mu mbembu ghulu dji baNgereke. </note>.»<verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Kaboghu, kesunzanu va wusu Nzambi. Waranu va wusu Dyabu, na odurine. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Bambenanu na Nzambi, djawandi obambene nenu. Susanu makake menu, djenu abeduvu bavayitsi ba mabi. Lyomisanu mirime myenu, batu abavu na mirime mighabu. <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Labanu maghughe menu, lilanu, tatanu, dikyeki dyenu dikaluyi kondu, nzangu enu djibi munyongu. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Kedyamisanu va wusu Fumu na odunangule.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batu bayaghelesenaange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Baane ba tadji, duyaghélesenaange. Pa mutu evosi dibi mu mwane tadji andi na emugheli, kaboghu evosi dibi mu mughaghe Nzambi na ewugheli. Tumbe pa wigheli mughaghe, wughéwudedili, wiwusyembi yike usyembe. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Bu Nzambi yiveyi mughaghe ombu batu. Nzonzi bu djandi. Djandi pinze o wurungule ughobule na orungule ubunge. Kaboghu ndedju anyi wuvu, ndedju wigheli mwane tadji aghu?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Duyabe na dunangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Djenu, wulwanu mbembu ami, djenu abedwivosi: «Na nyangu vo mughese, tuwende o musyengi awune, tuyévyose yilime yimosi, tuvaghe bukoli mu udile mbongu.» <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Djenu abedwivosi nane, dughédjabi ne adwiyuduruyile mughese. Dudji nane mwa dimungi adipali mwa pesu temu, mba ditsyemuyi. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Mbé dwivosi nane: «Pa Fumu atsironde, tube monyu, tuvaghe dyedi na dyedi.» <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Tumbe duvumbe dwenu dwiruyili mu dunangu, ave dwikerutsuli nane dyoni dilasi yiri dune dunangu, digha diboti. <verse eid="JAS 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Pa mutu edjabi uvaghe diboti mba aghédivayi, kaboghu dibi evayi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Djenu bisine, kebenanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Djenu bisine, wulwanu mbembu ami. Rodulanu ulile na tatanu! Dibandu maghughe amoduruyile. <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Busine bwenu bumabungene. Bikutu byenu bisyeghe na batsyelili. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Mbongu tsyenu na mamani menu ma kembu bimabase maali. Dufundusu na maali meni. Dunyuru dwenu dubungu, dunyenzu. Dutsiwukighe busine yoyine tuke mu temu tsyusite. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Dutsidyonge basatsi abatsisale mu manungi menu, dughabafute. Ulilebelili na mitatu myowu mimatole tena ombu Nzambi, Fumu mabadi. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Dutsibeghe monyu wu maboti mu butambe, dwivayi mambu ame dwirondi, dwidji burange, mba dwivongi nane bibulu abibungulu, bikeboku mu ulighu. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Dutsifundise batu abaghavaghe dibi, dutsibaboke wandi. Tumbe djowu baghaghaghene.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Banu na pughu na sambilanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Baane ba tadji, banu na pughu tena durughulu du Fumu. Tasanu muvaritsi ekeli na pughu milunde ami fwaru mi bivaru byandi, tena byubure. Ekeli mamvule amateghe na mamvule ma usite ameroyisi milunde. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Djenu wandi banu na pughu, wangelenanu. Banu na yikanene mumbari yilumbu ayi Fumu etu oghabuyile yimabambene.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Baane ba tadji, duyafundesenaange mumba Nzambi akédukilise. Wulwanu, nzonzi amabambene, ake va mune ndaghu. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Baane ba tadji, mu dyambu di ditsoghe na pughu, bonganu yibaghunu yi babiyitsi abamavose mu dine di Fumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Twivosyanu yi badji mu maboti, mumbari bamawarile. Mu Sobe, dumaghulu tsyeni amawarile mu temu ditsoghe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:20-22">Sob 1.20-22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:10">2.10</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 42:10-17">42.10-17</ref></char></note>. Djenu wandi, dwidjabi kabusulu adji Fumu Nzambi amamuveghe va disukusulu. Ngenze, Fumu Nzambi ane yingebe yi batu na ebavayi maboti.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Baane ba tadji, viri-viri pa dwivosi dyambu, duyaleve pesi. Duyaleva Nzambi, duyaleva butambe, duyaleva pesi mu dyambu dyotsu. Pa dyambu didji ngenze, vosanu: «yine». Pa dyufure, vose yi «nesi». Vosanu nane mumbari bunzonzi bu Nzambi bukédughaange.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Pa mutu va ghari enu etsoyi, asambili Nzambi. Pa mutu va ghari enu ane nzangu, awimbili noyitsi Fumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Pa mutu va ghari enu ane ubele, anengili bivunde bi dibundu, bakemusinge matsi na usambile mu dine di Fumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Dusambu nane dune dwivaghu na yitu, dubeluse yibedu mba Fumu omurelighe. Pa amavaghe mabi momutandu. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Kaboghu tandesenanu mabi menu na sambilanu mu bambatsi, mumbari Nzambi akedubeluse. Dusambu du mutu odjivu asungeme va wusu Nzambi dune mangolu maneni. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Tasetyanu Eli amabe mutu nane djetu. Amasambile Nzambi na yikanene mumba mvule djikémwénoghe. Ubandile va temu adjine mu bilime biryeru na yibuku, mvule djisamanoghe mu yinange yeni. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Va djulu vane, Eli amamwésambile mba mvule djikenoghe, na bivaru bikemwébende<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">Ka1 17.1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:1">18.1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:42-45">18.42-45</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ughabuse abatsyemughe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Baane ba tadji, pa mutu va ghari enu amasile nzile Nzambi vale, mba wumosi emughabusi mu nzile eni, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>djabanu yiri, mutu oyighabusi muvayitsi mabi mu nzile, emughobuli o dufu. Nesi mabi mandi mabe pwele, Nzambi omutande moni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Ban 10.12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:8">1Py 4.8</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
